c \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng thu\u7871\'3f su\u7845\'3ft l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc b\u7893\'3f sung ho\u7863\'3fc thu\u7871\'3f su\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c}{\rtlch\fcs1 
