\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848 \'f0\u7873\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp m\'f4n b\'e0i tu\u7923\'3f theo t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f hay c\'e1 th\u7875\'3f thu\u7871\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp 3% tr\'ean doanh s\u7889
\'3f thu\u7927\'3f h\u7843\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn \'f0\'e1nh b\u7855\'3ft b\'e1n ra v\'e0 thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc thu tr\'ean l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f theo bi\u7875\'3fu \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899
\'3fi ng\'e0nh s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft. 
\par \'d0\u7875\'3f th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\u7897\'3fng vi\'ean v\'e0 \'f0\'f5n gi\u7843\'3fn c\'e1ch t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f, c\'e1c Chi c\u7909\'3fc thu\u7871\'3f c\'f9ng c\'f5 quan thu\u7927\'3f s\u7843\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7883\'3f
a ph\'fd\'f5ng \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tra, nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng \'f0\'e1nh b\u7855\'3ft v\'e0 thu nh\u7853\'3fp th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc ngh\u7873\'3f \'f0\'e1nh b
\u7855\'3ft, t\'ednh to\'e1n thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc v\'e0 quy ra t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f thu tr\'ean doanh s\u7889\'3f (c\'f3 ph\'e2n bi\u7879\'3ft chi\u7871\'3fu c\u7889\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f h\'f5n c\'e1 th
\u7875\'3f, c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f c\'f3 s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng thu nh\u7853\'3fp \'edt h\'f5n c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f c\'f3 s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng thu nh\u7853\'3fp cao) \'f0\u7875\'3f thu theo m\u7897\'3ft t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f g\u7897\'3fp v\'f5
\'ed thu\u7871\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc tr\'ean doanh thu. C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f l\u7845\'3fy s\u7843\'3fn l\'fd\u7907\'3fng k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch th\'fd\u7901\'3f
ng ni\'ean c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f \u7893\'3fn \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng n\'e3m. 
\par Nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc l\'e0 thu\u7871\'3f c\'f4ng th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp thu b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn, nh\'fdng \'f0\u7875\'3f h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f cho ng\'e0nh H\u7843\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn th\'f4ng qua thu\u7871\'3f, n\u7855\'3fm s\u7843\'3f
n ph\u7849\'3fm, \u7903\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng n\'f5i c\'f5 quan h\u7843\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn c\'f3 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn thu b\u7857\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848 
\'ec c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848 \'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f c\'f9ng v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan h\u7843\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th
\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f ra quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho thu thu\u7871\'3f b\u7857\'3fng hi\u7879\'3fn v\u7853\'3ft. C\'f5 quan h\u7843\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm thanh to\'e1n \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f k\u7883\'3f
p th\u7901\'3fi t\u7893\'3fng s\u7889\'3f thu\u7871\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f n\u7897\'3fp hi\u7879\'3fn v\u7853\'3ft v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848 3. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848 Thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848 Nghi\'eam ch\u7881\'3fnh th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc thu thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi t\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c lo
\u7841\'3fi h\'e0ng thu\u7897\'3fc di\u7879\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1, do c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc c\'e1 th\u7875\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft v\'e0 theo \'f0\'fang thu\u7871\'3f su
\u7845\'3ft quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh trong bi\u7875\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 ban h\'e0nh theo Ph\'e1p l\u7879\'3fnh ng\'e0y 26/2/1983 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. 
\par Gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 n\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7883\'3fa l\'e0 gi\'e1 b\'e1n l\u7867\'3f trung b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848 \'ecnh tr\'ean th\u7883\'3f tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848 \'fd\u7901\'3fng tr\u7915\'3f 10% (hay n\'f3i c\'e1ch kh\'e1c l\'e0 gi\'e1 b\'e1n bu\'f4n \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848 \'e3 c\'f3 thu
\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3499108\charrsid8397848  c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft). Gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f do Chi c\u7909\'3fc thu\u7871\'3f c\'f4ng th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879
\'3fp t\u7881\'3fnh hay th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh. M\u7895\'3fi khi gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f t\'e3ng gi\u7843\'3fm t\u7915\'3f 20% tr\u7903\'3f l\'ean ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ch\u7881\'3fnh l\u7841\'3fi gi\'e1 t\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f. 

\par Lo\u7841\'3fi h\'e0ng do c\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc c\'e1 th\u7875\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft v\'e0 ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f qua c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f gia c\'f4
ng, thu mua kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng ho\'e1 nh\'fdng ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp, theo nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc nh\'fd sau:
